From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hw-4 <hw-4@local>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test: keep the libeis header build-test buildable under
 clang-15 on OHOS

test/meson.build compiles the header self-containment stub with a
hard-coded -Werror. On OHOS that turns two benign diagnostics into a
build failure at project() time:

  1) clang-15: error: -Wl,--code-sign: 'linker' input unused
     [-Werror,-Wunused-command-line-argument]
     FAILED: test/test-build-libeis.p/buildtest.c.o
     The OHOS clang wrapper (usr/local/bin/aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos-clang)
     appends "-Wl,--code-sign" to every invocation, compile-only steps
     included, so the linker argument looks unused there.

  2) clang-15: error: unused parameter 'argc' [-Werror,-Wunused-parameter]
     (and 'argv') — the stub is main(int argc, char **argv){ return 0; }
     and the project builds with -Wall -Wextra.

Only these two warnings are demoted, for this one target: -Werror stays
in force for every other diagnostic, and no signing flag is removed or
altered (it is required for the final binaries on OHOS). The C++ twin
target is untouched - meson does not apply these c_args to it, so it
merely warns.

Mechanism (1) is the meson instance of what was already recorded for
CMake (unittest-cpp 2.0.0) and a bare Makefile (usbrelay 1.0).
---
 test/meson.build | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/test/meson.build b/test/meson.build
index 4ca18e9..b0f8833 100644
--- a/test/meson.build
+++ b/test/meson.build
@@ -130,7 +130,12 @@ if build_libeis
                'buildtest.c',
                dependencies: [dep_libeis],
                include_directories: [inc_src],
-               c_args: ['-Werror', '-DINCLUDE_LIBEIS=1'],
+               # clang-15 on OHOS turns two benign diagnostics into build errors here: the
+               # toolchain wrapper injects -Wl,--code-sign into compile-only (-c) steps,
+               # and -Wextra flags this header build-test's unused argc/argv.
+               # Both are demoted for this target only; -Werror still rules everything else.
+               c_args: ['-Werror', '-Wno-error=unused-command-line-argument',
+                        '-Wno-error=unused-parameter', '-DINCLUDE_LIBEIS=1'],
                install: false,
     )
 endif
